  "summary": {
    "title": "Professional Summary",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "content": "<p>PMP-certified Capital Project Manager with 13+ years of end-to-end experience delivering large-scale chemical and specialty materials facility projects across Taiwan, the US, and Vietnam. Proven track record as an <strong>owner's representative</strong> on projects ranging from $700K to $1.2B, managing EPC contractors, multi-disciplinary engineering teams, and complex regulatory compliance. Deep hands-on experience in <strong>high-purity chemical and specialty gas supply systems</strong> for TSMC advanced-node fabs. Bilingual (Chinese/English), accustomed to reporting to international leadership and coordinating cross-cultural teams. PMP-certified with a Chemical Engineering degree from National Taiwan University.</p>"
  },
