          "website": { "url": "", "label": "" },
          "description": "<ul><li>Led development and integration of EV platform (TSP/HPC firmware, SOVD diagnostics, OTA orchestration) for CEER, Saudi Arabia's first EV brand.</li><li>Managed cross-functional team of 10+ engineers and coordinated multiple hardware/software suppliers; delivered on schedule and within budget.</li><li>Structured and tracked complex multi-vendor scopes using AI-augmented requirement tracing and milestone alignment workflows.</li></ul>"
