          "website": { "url": "", "label": "" },
          "description": "<ul><li>Led preparation and submission of government tender proposals; aligned technical scope with regulatory requirements.</li><li>Conducted market and competitor analysis to enhance bid positioning and identify strategic differentiators.</li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-abcd-ef0123456704",
          "hidden": false,
          "company": "Formosa Chemicals & Fibre",
          "position": "Advanced Project Manager",
          "location": "Taipei, Taiwan & Louisiana, USA",
          "period": "Dec 2011 - Jan 2022",
          "website": { "url": "", "label": "" },
          "description": "<ul><li><strong>Owner's Representative</strong> for the <strong>Sunshine Project</strong> — a <strong>$1.2B greenfield petrochemical complex</strong> in Louisiana, USA — from process R&amp;D through FEL-1/2/3, FEED, permitting, and EPC execution.</li><li>Secured air emission permits and land-use permits (U.S. Army Corps of Engineers) for a Tier-1 industrial facility in 2018.</li><li>Delivered EPC construction with <strong>zero change orders</strong>, on-time completion, and <strong>zero casualties or near-misses</strong>.</li><li>Conducted feasibility studies and financial modeling that secured Final Investment Decision from senior leadership.</li><li>Negotiated EPC and technical services contracts, securing multi-million USD in added value.</li><li>Led <strong>$30M Power Plant FGD Project (Vietnam)</strong>: developed advanced FGD process; led cross-national team to on-stream delivery.</li><li>Led <strong>$700K Power Plant SCR Project (Taiwan)</strong>: implemented NOx control using aqueous ammonia; served as Construction Manager coordinating multi-disciplinary installation.</li></ul>"
